targets::tar_source("R_functions")
knitr::opts_chunk$set(cache = TRUE)
```




#  MPX NYC: Results {#sec-appendixresults}




## People




### Race and gender {.unnumbered}


::: {.panel-tabset}
#### Show plot



```{r plot_bar_demogroup}
#| fig-height: 5
#| fig-width: 5
#| fig-align: center

make_table_freq1(demo_group) |>  
  plot_bar() +
  theme_mpxnyc_bar() +
  scale_axis_mpxnyc() +
  scale_fill_mpxnyc(name = "Race / gender") +
  theme_mpxnyc_nomargin()

```



#### Show data



```{r table_bar_demogroup}


make_table_freq1(demo_group) |>
  draw_table_1("Race-Gender")
```



:::



